---
import { footerLinks } from '../../data/home';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<!-- ══ FOOTER ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<footer>
  <div class="ft">
    <div class="ft-brand-block">
      <span class="ft-logo" aria-label="Rushes Media">
        <img src={SITE.logoIcon} alt="" class="ft-crest" width="833" height="959" loading="lazy" />
        <img src={SITE.logoWordmark} alt="Rushes Media" class="ft-wordmark" width="2888" height="322" loading="lazy" />
      </span>
      <p>Media, demand and follow-up built as one accountable path to the calendar.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="ft-nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <span>Explore</span>
      <ul class="ft-links">
        {footerLinks.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="ft-contact">
      <span>South Jersey · Philadelphia · Mid-Atlantic</span>
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
      <a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ft-bottom">
    <p>© 2026 {SITE.legalName} · {SITE.address}</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a> · SMS opt-in is on the booking form only.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
